#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "671\t719"
msgid "Hey, man."
msgstr "Hey, kyoudai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "720\t776"
msgid "Yo."
msgstr "Yo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "777\t842"
msgid "Oh, Majima-san!\\nWhat brings you by?"
msgstr "¡Oh, Majima-san!\\n¡Bienvenido!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "852\t912"
msgid "Eh, just figured I'd drop in."
msgstr "Con su permiso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "968\t1065"
msgid "Man, we got a real scorcher out there."
msgstr "Pero qué calor hace..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1069\t1181"
msgid "I'm not used to sweatin' my jewels off\\nthis time of year. It's only April!"
msgstr "Apenas estamos en abril,\\n¿qué demonios con todo este calor?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1182\t1278"
msgid "Heard it's almost hittin' 90 today."
msgstr "Escuché que estamos por llegar a los 30°C."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1272\t1371"
msgid "Whole country's gonna be up in flames before long."
msgstr "Como siga así, el país va a terminar hecho cenizas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1372\t1471"
msgid "Country? Try the whole world."
msgstr "¿Solo el país? Yo diría que el mundo entero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1474\t1603"
msgid "We're tearin' this speck of cosmic dust apart."
msgstr "Se dice que es culpa de la tan hablada contaminación ambiental."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1606\t1665"
msgid "Look at you soundin' all educated."
msgstr "Vaya, suenas inteligente y todo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1666\t1801"
msgid "Hey, I know some stuff.\\nOzone layer's going to shit, too."
msgstr "Oye, pero claro que sé.\\nTenía que ver con el ozono o algo así."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1803\t1842"
msgid "Says who?"
msgstr "¿Quién te lo dijo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1843\t1903"
msgid "My boss."
msgstr "Pues mi jefe."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1912\t1964"
msgid "Shimano-han said that?"
msgstr "¿Shimano-han te dijo eso?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1966\t2096"
msgid "Moanin' about the environment's\\nthe hip new thing to do."
msgstr "Hablar del medio ambiente\\nes lo que esta de moda hoy en día."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2098\t2244"
msgid "Even yakuza are comin' out saying\\nwe gotta take care of the planet."
msgstr "Incluso en la yakuza se empieza a decir\\nque hay que preocuparse por el planeta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2256\t2301"
msgid "Morons."
msgstr "Qué estupidez."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2415\t2451"
msgid "Here."
msgstr "Miren."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2496\t2556"
msgid "A watermelon!"
msgstr "¡Una sandía!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2553\t2683"
msgid "Right on. Perfect refresher\\non a blazin' day like this."
msgstr "Así es. Lo ideal para refrescar\\nun día infernal como este."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2699\t2835"
msgid "I didn't realize they sold them\\nthis big so early in the spring!"
msgstr "¡No pensé que estuviesen vendiendo\\nunas así de grandes a inicios de primavera!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2838\t2900"
msgid "Not for cheap, they don't."
msgstr "Aunque un poco caro..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2905\t3024"
msgid "But I don't think we're gonna be eatin'\\nstuff like this where we're goin'."
msgstr "Dudo que podamos comer\\n este tipo de cosas a donde vamos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3025\t3094"
msgid "Call it an early celebration."
msgstr "Es como una celebración anticipada."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3108\t3168"
msgid "Celebrating what?"
msgstr "¿Celebración?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3241\t3285"
msgid "Yasuko."
msgstr "Yasuko."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3288\t3365"
msgid "Ain't every day Majima drops by."
msgstr "Ya que mi kyoudai se tomó la molestia de venir,"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3390\t3459"
msgid "Mind grabbin' us a few beers?"
msgstr "¿por qué no compras unas cervezas?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3456\t3565"
msgid "Not at all. Be back soon!"
msgstr "Voy, voy. ¡Ya vengo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3688\t3753"
msgid "You guys want snacks, too?"
msgstr "¿Quieren algunos bocadillos también?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3789\t3815"
msgid "Yeah, sounds good."
msgstr "Sí, suena bien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3816\t3876"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Lo tengo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4200\t4305"
msgid "So. You're keepin' Yasuko-chan in the dark."
msgstr "Oye, ¿aún no se lo dices a Yasuko-chan?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4339\t4392"
msgid "Don't got much choice."
msgstr "No tengo elección."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4400\t4512"
msgid "Not gonna just up and say\\nwe're offin' a bunch of guys tomorrow."
msgstr "No puedo ir decirle que mañana\\nvoy a matar un grupo de personas, así, sin más."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4513\t4599"
msgid "Ya don't gotta put it like that."
msgstr "Pero no se lo digas de esa manera."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4605\t4700"
msgid "Just tell her we'll be gone on business for a while."
msgstr "Dile que nos iremos de negocios por un tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4702\t4785"
msgid "At least say goodbye.\\nYa owe her that much."
msgstr "Al menos despídete.\\nEs mejor hacerlo a que no."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4786\t4885"
msgid "Hell with that.\\nIt's bad luck."
msgstr "¡No digas esas cosas!\\n¡Trae mala suerte!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5104\t5182"
msgid "Speakin' of, though."
msgstr "Oi, ya que hablamos de eso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5199\t5292"
msgid "You bring 'em?"
msgstr "¿Las trajiste?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5302\t5362"
msgid "Sure did."
msgstr "Sí."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5867\t5945"
msgid "These babies are the real deal."
msgstr "Completamente auténticas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5940\t6060"
msgid "Come checked and certified\\nstraight from the Dojima Family."
msgstr "Directamente verificadas y\\nadquiridas por la familia Dojima."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6184\t6255"
msgid "Six handguns."
msgstr "Un total de seis pistolas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6256\t6332"
msgid "Each one with six rounds."
msgstr "Cada una con seis rondas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6333\t6409"
msgid "Makin' for 36 slugs total."
msgstr "Un total de treinta y seis disparos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6414\t6490"
msgid "36, huh?"
msgstr " Treinta y seis, eh..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6514\t6685"
msgid "Should be enough for Yoshiharu Ueno.\\nAnd whatever Seiwa Clan thugs he's got with him."
msgstr "Suficiente para Yoshiharu Ueno y\\ncualquiera del clan Seiwa que esté con él."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6693\t6753"
msgid "How many we figurin'?"
msgstr "¿Cuántas personas crees que habrán?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6767\t6848"
msgid "Single digits. Ten max."
msgstr "Alrededor de diez."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6857\t7003"
msgid "So we got three, maybe four shots a man."
msgstr "Serían como tres o cuatro balas para cada uno, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7033\t7088"
msgid "I'll take it."
msgstr "Más que suficiente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7607\t7667"
msgid "Listen, bro."
msgstr "Oye, kyoudai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7771\t7860"
msgid "If you want out, now's the time."
msgstr "Este es buen momento para dar marcha atrás."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7910\t7965"
msgid "It's two on ten."
msgstr "Dos contra diez."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7966\t8094"
msgid "Ugly odds,\\neven with the element of surprise."
msgstr "Incluso haciendo un ataque sorpresa,\\ntenemos una clara desventaja."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8113\t8262"
msgid "And say we do pull it off...\\nThat's ten years, minimum."
msgstr "Y si tenemos éxito...\\ncomo mínimo estaremos una década entre rejas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8282\t8344"
msgid "Could be for life."
msgstr "O podría ser una vida entera."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8345\t8404"
msgid "We might even hang for it."
msgstr "O la pena de muerte."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8626\t8702"
msgid "Me? I'm a lone wolf."
msgstr "Yo estoy completamente solo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8711\t8831"
msgid "I've been ready to die for this\\nsince the day I called Shimano my boss."
msgstr "Desde que empecé a llamar jefe a Shimano,\\nestoy preparado para cualquier cosa."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "8852\t8965"
msgid "But you?\\nYou've got Yasuko-chan."
msgstr "Pero tú,\\ntienes a Yasuko-chan."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "9057\t9117"
msgid "Saejima."
msgstr "Saejima."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "9110\t9220"
msgid "You sure you can just leave her behind like that?"
msgstr "¿Estás seguro de abandonar a Yasuko-chan?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "9284\t9344"
msgid "Bro."
msgstr "Kyoudai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "9386\t9471"
msgid "You're lettin' your Kansai accent slip."
msgstr "Te olvidaste de hablar con tu Kansai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "9526\t9614"
msgid "Come on, I'm being serious here!"
msgstr "Vamos, te estoy hablando de algo serio..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "9615\t9683"
msgid "My decision's made."
msgstr "Yo también estoy preparado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "9800\t9872"
msgid "You'd die for your boss, yeah?"
msgstr "Soy igual que tú."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "9887\t9984"
msgid "Then no shit I'm ready to do\\nthe same for Sasai."
msgstr "Haré cualquier cosa por mi jefe Sasai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "9999\t10059"
msgid "And..."
msgstr "Además..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "10049\t10109"
msgid "And what?"
msgstr "¿Además?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "10223\t10283"
msgid "I gotta know, brother."
msgstr "Me gustaría saber."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "10317\t10577"
msgid "Just how far Taiga Saejima can climb\\nup the Tojo Clan totem pole. Ya get me?"
msgstr "Hasta dónde puede llegar un hombre como\\nTaiga Saejima dentro del Clan Tojo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "10640\t10700"
msgid "Saejima..."
msgstr "Saejima..."

